<aside class="privacy-fulfillment-note section" aria-labelledby="PrivacyFulfillmentHeading"><p class="eyebrow">Aloir Apparel / Additional privacy information</p><h2 id="PrivacyFulfillmentHeading">Fulfillment &amp; saved pieces</h2><div class="rte"><p>We use Trendsi to fulfill US orders. We share the order and delivery information needed to pack, ship and support your purchase with our fulfillment partner and delivery carriers.</p><p>Saved pieces are stored in your browser and do not synchronize between devices. Remove them through the saved-pieces controls or your browser’s site-data settings. Clearing site data can also reset shopping preferences.</p><p>For privacy questions or requests, {% render 'policy-contact' %}. Your rights and Shopify’s processing are described in the privacy policy above.</p></div></aside>
